me": "is_surgical_area",\n    "description": "出血部位是否为手术区域",\n    "required": true,\n    "question_template": "请问出血部位是否为手术区域？",\n    "options": [\n      {\n        "key": "A",\n        "label": "是"\n      },\n      {\n        "key": "B",\n        "label": "否"\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    "name": "cause_trigger",\n    "description": "出血诱因",\n    "required": true,\n    "question_template": "近期是否有咬硬物、漱口过猛、缝线松动、佩戴义齿/保持器或服用抗凝药等诱因？如果有，请描述具体情况。"\n  },\n  {\n    "name": "latest_time",\n    "description": "术后时间",\n    "required": true,\n    "question_template": "请问出血发生在术后多久？（例如：手术后12小时/3天/一周）"\n  },\n  {\n    "name": "symptom_description",\n    "description": "伴随症状",\n    "required": true,\n    "question_template": "是否伴随伤口疼痛、裂开，或出现发热、乏力、淋巴结肿大等全身症状？",\n    "condition": "slots.get(\'latest_time\', {}).get(\'value\') == \'late\'"\n  },\n  {\n    "name": "surgery_type",\n    "description": "手术类型",\n    "required": true,\n    "question_template": "本次接受了什么手术或治疗？（可多选，最多4项）",\n    "options": [\n      {\n        "key": "A",\n        "label": "II期手术"\n      },\n      {\n        "key": "B",\n        "label": "上颌窦外提升植骨术"\n      },\n      {\n        "key": "C",\n        "label": "上颌窦内提升植骨术"\n      },\n      {\n        "key": "D",\n        "label": "软组织移植术"\n      },\n      {\n        "key": "E",\n        "label": "上颌前牙种植"\n      },\n      {\n        "key": "F",\n        "label": "上颌后牙种植"\n      },\n      {\n        "key": "G",\n        "label": "下颌前牙种植"\n      },\n      {\n        "key": "H",\n        "label": "下颌后牙种植"\n      },\n      {\n        "key": "I",\n        "label": "拔牙即刻种植术"\n      },\n      {\n        "key": "J",\n        "label": "位点保存术"\n      },\n      {\n        "key": "K",\n        "label": "块状骨移植术"\n      },\n      {\n        "key": "L",\n        "label": "骨柱植骨术"\n      },\n      {\n        "key": "M",\n        "label": "引导骨再生技术"\n      },\n      {\n        "key": "N",\n        "label": "上颌无牙颌种植术"\n      },\n      {\n        "key": "O",\n        "label": "下颌无牙颌种植术"\n      },\n      {\n        "key": "P",\n        "label": "种植体取出术"\n      },\n      {\n        "key": "Q",\n        "label": "牙齿拔除术"\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    "name": "bleeding_severity",\n    "description": "出血严重程度",\n    "required": true,\n    "question_template": "当前出血表现更接近哪种情况？A. 轻微渗血；B. 伤口持续鲜红出血；C. 其他表现。",\n    "options": [\n      {\n        "key": "A",\n        "label": "轻微渗血",\n        "image_url": "https://sanora.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/resources/light_bleed_30k.jpg"\n      },\n      {\n        "key": "B",\n        "label": "伤口持续鲜红出血",\n        "image_url": "https://sanora.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/resources/move_bleed.jpg"\n      },\n      {\n        "key": "C",\n        "label": "其他表现",\n        "input_type": "text",\n        "placeholder": "请详细描述您的出血情况（如：出血量、颜色、持续时间等）"\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    "name": "bleeding_location",\n    "description": "出血部位",\n    "required": true,\n    "question_template": "请问出血发生在哪个区域？",\n    "options": [\n      {\n        "key": "A",\n        "label": "舌侧（舌头下方、舌底）"\n      },\n      {\n        "key": "B",\n        "label": "腭侧（上颚、上方）"\n      }\n    ],\n    "condition": "slots.get(\'bleeding_severity\', {}).get(\'value\') in [\'active\', \'minor\']"\n  },\n  {\n    "name": "can_compress",\n    "description": "是否可以压迫止血",\n    "required": true,\n    "question_template": "当前部位是否能够使用干净纱布或棉卷进行压迫止血？",\n    "condition": "slots.get(\'bleeding_severity\', {}).get(\'value\') == \'active\'"\n  },\n  {\n    "name": "rebleed_after_compression",\n    "description": "压迫后是否再次出血",\n    "required": true,\n    "question_template": "压迫止血后是否仍然持续或再次出血？",\n    "condition": "slots.get(\'can_compress\', {}).get(\'value\') == \'can\'"\n  }\n]\n\n# 已收集槽位\n\n- 出血部位是否为手术区域: 未收集\n- 出血诱因: 未收集\n- 术后时间: 未收集\n- 伴随症状: 未收集\n- 手术类型: 未收集\n- 出血严重程度: 未收集\n- 出血部位: 未收集\n- 是否可以压迫止血: 未收集\n- 压迫后是否再次出血: 未收集\n\n# 当前待收集槽位\n\n**is_surgical_area**\n\n请判断用户的回答是否包含该槽位的有效信息。\n\n# 对话历史\n\n[\n  {\n    "type": "human",\n    "content": "你好，我种完牙之后流了好多血，还觉得舌头麻，怎么办"\n  },\n  {\n    "type": "ai",\n    "content": "我理解突然出血会让您感到紧张，请先深呼吸、保持冷静，我会一步步指导您处理。\\n\\n请问出血部位是否为手术区域？"\n  },\n  {\n    "type": "human",\n    "content": "是"\n  }\n]\n\n# 用户最新消息\n\n是\n\n# 你的任务\n\n分析用户最新消息，提取槽位信息。\n\n1. **判断用户回答是否针对当前待收集槽位 `is_surgical_area`**\n2. **提取槽位值**：\n   - 对于 `cause_trigger`（诱因）：\n     - "没有"/"无"/"不知道" → 值为 `"none"`\n     - 如果提到具体诱因 → 原样记录\n   - 对于 `latest_time`（术后时间）：\n     - 提取时间描述，保持原文\n   - 对于其他槽位：分析用户回答，提取对应值\n3. **识别患者情绪**：`anxious`/`calm`/`urgent`\n\n**注意**：如果用户回答"没有"/"无"，`slot_valid` 应为 `true`，`value` 应为 `"none"`\n', 'role': 'user'}], 'model': 'qwen-flash', 'frequency_penalty': 0.0, 'max_completion_tokens': 8096, 'presence_penalty': 0.0, 'response_format': {'type': 'json_schema', 'json_schema': {'schema': {'$defs': {'SlotUpdate': {'description': '单个槽位的更新信息', 'properties': {'value': {'default': '', 'description': '标准化的槽位值', 'title': 'Value', 'type': 'string'}, 'raw': {'default': '', 'description': '用户原始回答', 'title': 'Raw', 'type': 'string'}, 'confidence': {'default': 0.9, 'description': '提取结果的置信度 (0.0-1.0)', 'title': 'Confidence', 'type': 'number'}}, 'title': 'SlotUpdate', 'type': 'object', 'additionalProperties': False, 'required': ['value', 'raw', 'confidence']}}, 'description': 'Manager 槽位解析结果模型', 'properties': {'slot_updates': {'additionalProperties': {'$ref': '#/$defs/SlotUpdate'}, 'description': '槽位更新字典，key 为槽位名，value 为更新详情', 'title': 'Slot Updates', 'type': 'object'}, 'patient_emotion': {'default': 'calm', 'description': '患者情绪: calm=平静, anxious=焦虑, urgent=紧急', 'title': 'Patient Emotion', 'type': 'string'}, 'slot_valid': {'default': True, 'description': '用户回答是否针对当前待收集槽位（true=有效回答, false=完全不相关）', 'title': 'Slot Valid', 'type': 'boolean'}, 'reasoning': {'default': '', 'description': '简要说明解析逻辑', 'title': 'Reasoning', 'type': 'string'}}, 'title': 'ManagerResult', 'type': 'object', 'additionalProperties': False, 'required': ['slot_updates', 'patient_emotion', 'slot_valid', 'reasoning']}, 'name': 'ManagerResult', 'strict': True}}, 'seed': 4